{"3993220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "TrafficJam", "steam_appid": 3993220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Finally, you get to be the crazy one in traffic!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of the daily grind on the highway? Then jump into the <i>Traffic Jam </i>the only game where standing still is just as exciting as speeding!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this not-so-relaxing game, you can finally unleash all the frustration you usually feel on real highways but virtually.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To keep things interesting, you can unlock and tune new rides. Depending on the car, you’ll even unlock some wacky weapons to help you push your way forward through the traffic jungle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And most importantly: <strong>the flex!</strong> Always aim for the top of the leaderboard and show the world how fast you can make it through a jam.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shrink Ray</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993220/extras/1f3e18cd9a63d1b4d1aa491936e9be9c.poster.avif?t=1759858800\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993220/extras/1f3e18cd9a63d1b4d1aa491936e9be9c.webm?t=1759858800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993220/extras/1f3e18cd9a63d1b4d1aa491936e9be9c.mp4?t=1759858800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the Shrink Ray, you can miniaturize other drivers and slip right past them. But watch out: after a while, they’ll grow back to full size so don’t waste time!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tire Shredder</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993220/extras/925ac76468ff1a82667222c62ca422ff.poster.avif?t=1759858800\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993220/extras/925ac76468ff1a82667222c62ca422ff.webm?t=1759858800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993220/extras/925ac76468ff1a82667222c62ca422ff.mp4?t=1759858800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Tire Shredder strategically to create gaps you can squeeze through. Or, if you’re in the mood for chaos, why not start your very own traffic jam… inside a traffic jam?</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Finally, you get to be the crazy one in traffic!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of the daily grind on the highway? Then jump into the <i>Traffic Jam </i>the only game where standing still is just as exciting as speeding!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this not-so-relaxing game, you can finally unleash all the frustration you usually feel on real highways but virtually.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To keep things interesting, you can unlock and tune new rides. Depending on the car, you’ll even unlock some wacky weapons to help you push your way forward through the traffic jungle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And most importantly: <strong>the flex!</strong> Always aim for the top of the leaderboard and show the world how fast you can make it through a jam.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shrink Ray</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993220/extras/1f3e18cd9a63d1b4d1aa491936e9be9c.poster.avif?t=1759858800\" width=560 height=240 ><sou